 "source": "WordPress 7.0.2 (local copy ~/.wp-env/wp-env-wporg-4.0.0-f26facd6/WordPress), wp-content/themes/twentytwentytwo/inc/patterns/page-about-media-right.php (Twenty Twenty-Two), rendered with en_US strings (escaping functions reduced to htmlspecialchars, get_template_directory_uri() = https://example.test/wp-content/themes/<theme>) — the markup WordPress registers for this pattern. Core blocks from core code, not measured.",
